Edit /etc/docker/daemon.json:
```json
{
  "log-driver": "json-file",
  "log-opts": { "max-size": "10m", "max-file": "3" }
}
```
Then `sudo systemctl restart docker`. Settings apply to newly created containers.

```bash
case "$1" in
  mula|start) mula_servis ;;
  henti|stop) henti_servis ;;
  *) echo "guna: $0 {mula|henti}"; exit 1 ;;
esac
```
Cleaner than if-chains for subcommands; `*)` default must show usage. Each branch ends `;;` — missing it falls through silently.
